{"id":10168,"artist":"KISS","title":"World Without Heroes","lyrics_plain":"A world without heroes\nIs like a world without sun\nYou can't look up to anyone\nWithout heroes\nAnd a world without heroes\nIs like a never-ending race\nIs like a time without a place\nA pointless thing, devoid of grace\n\nWhere you don't know what you're after\nOr if something's after you\nAnd you don't know why you don't know\nIn a world without heroes\n\nIn a world without dreams\nThings are no more than they seem\nAnd a world without heroes\nIs like a bird without wings\nOr a bell that never rings\nJust a sad and useless thing\n\nWhere you don't know what you're after\nOr if something's after you\nAnd you don't know why you don't know\n\nIn a world without heroes\nThere's nothing to be\nIt's no place for me","lyrics_synced":"[00:15.80] A world without heroes\n[00:19.55] Is like a world without sun\n[00:22.77] You can't look up to anyone\n[00:25.98] Without heroes\n[00:28.66] A world without heroes\n[00:32.41] Is like a never ending race\n[00:35.62] Is like a time without a place\n[00:39.91] A pointless thing devoid of grace\n[00:44.20] Where you don't know what you're after\n[00:48.48] Or if something's after you\n[00:52.77] You don't know why you don't know\n[00:55.98] In a world without heroes\n[01:02.95] In a world without dreams\n[01:05.89] Things are no more than they seem\n[01:11.52] And a world without heroes\n[01:15.27] Is like a bird without wings\n[01:18.75] Or a bell that never rings\n[01:22.77] Just a sad and useless thing\n[01:27.05] Where you don't know what you're after\n[01:31.34] Or if something's after you\n[01:35.62] And you don't know why you don't know\n[02:16.57] In a world without heroes\n[02:22.22] There's nothing to be\n[02:27.86] It's no place for me\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:15.80] <00:15.80>A <00:16.07>world <00:16.60>with <00:16.78>out <00:17.41>he <00:17.67>roes\n[00:19.55] <00:19.55>Is <00:19.82>like <00:20.08>a <00:20.35>world <00:20.89>with <00:21